{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe rain in the Rhine passenger boat this morning was miserable, but the view saved it. At Linz I visited the hilltop church Schulze recommended; the painting is adequate, though the climb was stiff. In Bonn, Windischmann and his son-in-law Walther were most agreeable. Windischmann is sharp, but Walther lacks that certain *Geist* I expect in a lawyer. We drank decent wine, though the price was steep.\n\nI am tired. The journey from Koblenz to here has worn me thin. I hope Karl and Immanuel are well, and that Ludwig is not giving the servants trouble with his temper. Tell me how the house is settled. I shall take a short walk tomorrow if the sky clears, but for now, I am exhausted.\n\nYours ever,\nHegel"}}],"created":1795219315,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":177,"prompt_tokens":1127,"total_tokens":1304,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-4fRUwtUNxAxzW0JB0pWkrw54Wx04Cocz","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1127,"prompt_ms":1124.814,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9980603371783496,"prompt_per_second":1001.943432425272,"predicted_n":177,"predicted_ms":4150.964,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.585022727272726,"predicted_per_second":42.39978954286281}}